// M3 language-boundary negative (): escrow-like state containers with release/refund
// transitions need L2 state semantics first — they are FUTURE source syntax, not core
// grammar. The frontend must reject `escrow` / `release` with "unexpected statement".
// See docs/language/LANGUAGE_BOUNDARY.md §3. Pinned by self-test [56].
procedure escrow_offer {
    input amount : money

    escrow funds until release
    release funds to beneficiary on settle
}
